# graphify — generated knowledge graph. TWO layers, only one of them rebuildable:
#   EXTRACTED layer — rebuild from docs/ via `/graphify docs`.
#   CURATED layer   — hand-authored concept nodes. Extraction does NOT regenerate these.
#                     They rebuild ONLY from docs/graph-fragments/ (tracked). See G51.
