# Supabase CLI local development stack (`D-120`).
# `supabase init` and `supabase start` write these; they are machine-local
# runtime state for the DISPOSABLE dev database and never describe the
# provisioned project. `supabase/migrations/` and `supabase/config.toml` ARE
# tracked — the migrations are the artifact and the config is the contract.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
